OL,3,GNEWSAFears branch cutting could damage
OL,4,Astressed trees
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer working to regenerate soil at
OL,7,Fa former potato farm has said an
OL,8,Fenforced date for cutting branches
OL,9,Fwould cause unnecessary damage to trees
OL,10,Fafter a "brutal summer" of drought.
OL,12,FThe deadline for the annual branchage -
OL,13,Fa legal requirement designed to keep
OL,14,Froads safe - is set by parish
OL,15,Fconstables and this year falls on
OL,16,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
