OL,3,GNEWSAFears branch cutting could damage
OL,4,Astressed trees
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganic farmer Nikki de Gruchy
OL,7,Fcriticised being "forced" to cut
OL,8,F"already stressed" 30-year-old bows on
OL,9,Fan "arbitrary date" when it could be
OL,10,Fdelayed to adhere to "conditions on the
OL,11,Fground".
OL,13,FAndy Jehan, chairman of the constables
OL,14,Fcommittee, said it had been an "unusual
OL,15,Fsummer", they would be happy to "speak
OL,16,Fto the industry about future years".
